000100*================================================================
000200* RDGDG  GADGET RISK DETAIL
000300*        THE 60-BYTE POL-RISK-DETAIL OF POLREC FOR LINE GDG.
000400*        USED BY RATGDG01.
000500*        policy-admin FILLS THE SAME 60 BYTES IN PRMCOMM
000600*        REQ-RISK-DETAIL WHEN IT CALLS PRMCALC0.
000700*
000800*  DEVICE-TYPE     P PHONE, T TABLET, L LAPTOP
000900*  DEVICE-AGE-MO   DEVICE AGE, MONTHS
001000*  ACCIDENTAL-DMG  Y = ACCIDENTAL DAMAGE COVER
001100*  LOSS-COVER      Y = LOSS AND THEFT COVER
001200*================================================================
001300 01  WS-GDG-DETAIL.
001400     05  WS-DEVICE-TYPE           PIC X(01).
001500     05  WS-DEVICE-AGE-MO         PIC 9(02).
001600     05  WS-ACCIDENTAL-DMG        PIC X(01).
001700     05  WS-LOSS-COVER            PIC X(01).
001800     05  FILLER                  PIC X(55).
